{"id":"664748","name":"梅干菜烧鸡爪","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/664748/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡爪","amount":"适量"},{"name":"梅干菜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜头","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"梅干菜提前泡发备用。","img":"images/664748/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"蒜头拍扁剁碎。","img":"images/664748/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"鸡爪去甲焯水后洗净备用。","img":"images/664748/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中热油放入蒜末炒香。","img":"images/664748/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入剁椒翻炒均匀。","img":"images/664748/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入鸡爪炒匀。","img":"images/664748/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入适量蚝油，生抽，老抽。","img":"images/664748/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"翻炒均匀上色入味。","img":"images/664748/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入梅干菜。","img":"images/664748/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"翻炒均匀。","img":"images/664748/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"炒过的鸡爪转入高压锅中，大火十分钟左右即可。","img":"images/664748/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664748/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664748/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：高压锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}